# Masters and cover art ARE committed, under label/audio and label/artwork.
# They had no version control and no off-machine copy anywhere else, and the
# ledger's measurements are meaningless without the files they describe.
# Only derived audio is excluded.

# Analyzer cache: deterministic PCM decodes and model output. Reproducible from
# the committed mp3s, ~1.6 GB, so disposable and never committed.
.cache/

# Sparks are the rawest human input in the system — the argument you actually
# had, the thing that annoyed you, the half-formed phrase. Deliberately NOT
# committed: git is permanent and this repo may go public. The derived brief
# under label/briefs/ is the part that belongs in the record, and the ledger
# references the spark by id so provenance survives without the text.
label/sparks/

# Direct-API settings. Holds model choices, never keys — keys come from the
# environment. Local anyway, since provider and model are a per-operator choice.
inference.local.yaml

# Credentials never belong in the tree at all. These patterns are a backstop, not
# a supported location.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
credentials.local.*

*.Zone.Identifier

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
